{"ticker":"CDNS","updated":"2026-11-20T22:44:30Z","profile":{"longName":"Cadence Design Systems, Inc.","shortName":"Cadence Design Systems, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"United States","website":"https://www.cadence.com","fullTimeEmployees":13800,"marketCap":77259636736,"trailingPE":55.980114,"forwardPE":28.600534,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":12.599221,"pegRatio":2.22,"targetMeanPrice":411.7604,"targetHighPrice":470.0,"targetLowPrice":300.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.22,"earningsGrowth":0.0,"grossMargins":0.85678,"operatingMargins":0.29937,"profitMargins":0.22514999,"totalRevenue":6132096000,"beta":1.102,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":416.69,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":262.75,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Cadence Design Systems, Inc. develops computational, AI-driven software, hardware, and silicon intellectual property products and solutions. The company offers functional verification services, such as Jasper, a formal verification platform; Xcelium, a parallel logic simulation platform; Verisium, a generative AI solution; Palladium, an enterprise emulation platform; and Protium, a prototyping platform for chip verification, as well as digital IC design and sign off products, including Innovus platform; and custom IC design and simulation product include Virtuoso, a platform to design and verify analog. It also provides Xcelium logic simulator and other front-end verification and virtual prototyping technologies; controllers and physical interfaces; PCI Express, universal accelerator and compute express links, and multiple memory interfaces; and Tensilica, a digital signal processor. In addition, the company's design IP portfolio includes serializer/deserializer, peripheral component interconnect, USB, and other standard protocols; and Secure-IC, a solution for embedded security IP. Additionally, it provides System Design and Analysis (SD&A) platform, a solution that enables end-to-end system-level design and verification across chips, packages, PCBs, and electronic systems; Allegro X and Orca X platforms for PCB and advanced packaging; Sigrity X for signal and power integrity;","summary_zh":"Cadence Design Systems, Inc. 開發計算、人工智慧驅動的軟體、硬體和矽知識產權產品和解決方案。本公司提供功能驗證服務，如形式化驗證平台Jasper； Xcelium，平行邏輯模擬平台； Verisium，生成式人工智慧解決方案； Palladium，企業模擬平台； Protium，一個用於晶片驗證的原型平台，以及數位 IC 設計和簽核產品，包括 Innovus 平台；客製化 IC 設計和驗證產品包括 Virtuoso，這是一個設計和驗證的模擬平台。還提供Xcelium邏輯模擬器等前端驗證和虛擬樣機技術；控制器和實體介面； PCI Express、通用加速器和計算高速鏈路以及多個記憶體介面；和 Tensilica，一種數位訊號處理器。此外，該公司的設計IP組合包括串行器/解串器、外圍組件互連、USB和其他標準協議；Secure-IC，嵌入式安全IP解決方案。此外，它還提供系統設計和分析 (SD&A) 平台，可實現跨晶片、封裝、PCB 和電子系統的端到端系統級設計和驗證；用於 PCB 和先進封裝的 Allegro X 和 Orca X 平台； Sigrity X 確保訊號和電源完整性；","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":370.0,"h":373.9,"l":364.7,"c":373.37,"v":1620300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":370.98,"h":371.84,"l":363.98,"c":366.3,"v":1527900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":366.71,"h":366.71,"l":355.8,"c":356.96,"v":1655800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":352.52,"h":355.03,"l":350.03,"c":351.06,"v":1921200},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":349.92,"h":351.09,"l":346.99,"c":350.11,"v":1299300},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":352.88,"h":352.88,"l":347.81,"c":348.52,"v":1207600},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":349.2,"h":352.05,"l":346.92,"c":351.26,"v":1195200},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":348.27,"h":355.15,"l":347.41,"c":351.97,"v":1156800},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":354.55,"h":355.14,"l":346.35,"c":347.24,"v":1649600},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":347.24,"h":353.15,"l":345.0,"c":347.27,"v":1056300},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":350.0,"h":354.85,"l":350.0,"c":353.36,"v":1441200},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":352.7,"h":353.33,"l":342.08,"c":345.48,"v":949300},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":346.07,"h":354.26,"l":346.07,"c":350.0,"v":1292800},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":348.25,"h":348.77,"l":343.58,"c":348.67,"v":1227200},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":348.1,"h":350.26,"l":325.86,"c":327.0,"v":2156100},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":329.75,"h":334.2,"l":324.94,"c":33